    purpose, legal/financial meaning, and likely filing intent for later retrieval.
    Use OCR evidence holistically; do not anchor on isolated words.
  classification_guidance: MOT certificates and DVSA vehicle test documents should
    be classified as vehicles, not invoice. Prefer vehicles for terms like MOT, DVSA,
    vehicle registration mark, test certificate, odometer, VIN, V5C. Optical documents
    (optometrist, eye test, prescription, lens specification, axis/prism/cyl values)
    should be medical, never payslip.
